flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/products/fixed-deposits\">मुद्दती निक्षेप<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/products/loans\">ऋण<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/services\">सेवाहरू<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/rates\">ब्याज दर<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/publications\">प्रकाशनहरू<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"group relative\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 font-heading text-sm font-medium transition-colors text-text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500\" href=\"/contact\">सम्पर्क</a></div></nav><button class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-6 w-6\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"hero-slider relative h-[70vh] min-h-[500px] max-h-[800px] overflow-hidden bg-black\"><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-100 z-10\" style=\"background-image:url(https://reliancenepal.com.np/assets/images/hero_digital_banking.png)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-0\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">Go Digital With RFL Smart Banking</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">Experience seamless mobile banking, QR payments, and digital transfers anytime, anywhere in Nepal.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/products/savings\">Open Account</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/rates\">View Rates</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://reliancenepal.com.np/assets/images/hero_fixed_deposits.png)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">Individual Fixed Deposits</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">Earn higher returns on your hard-earned savings. Open a fixed deposit with flexible tenures and lucrative rates.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/products/fixed-deposits\">Learn More</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/emi-calculator\">Calculate Earnings</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://reliancenepal.com.np/assets/images/hero_loans.png)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">Flexible Home &amp; Auto Loans</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">Turn your dreams into reality with low-interest home, vehicle, and agricultural loan options customized for you.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/products/loans\">Explore Loans</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/emi-calculator\">EMI Calculator</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://reliancenepal.com.np/assets/images/hero_governance.png)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">Corporate Governance &amp; Legacy</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">Guided by transparency, institutional integrity, and compliance under Nepal Rastra Bank regulations for over a decade.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/governance\">Governance Policies</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/governance\">Board of Directors</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slide absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-opacity duration-1000 flex items-center opacity-0 z-0\" style=\"background-image:url(https://reliancenepal.com.np/assets/images/hero_remittance.png)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/75 via-black/40 to-transparent z-[2]\"></div><div class=\"container-page relative z-[3] w-full transition-all duration-1000 translate-y-8\"><div class=\"max-w-[650px] text-white\"><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-extrabold leading-tight text-secondary-500\">Fast &amp; Secure Remittance</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-[clamp(1rem,2vw,1.25rem)] text-white/90\">Collect international and domestic money transfers easily across our nationwide branch network.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"/services/remittance\">Explore Remittance</a><a class=\"btn btn-outline !border-white !text-white hover:!bg-white/10\" href=\"/branches\">Locate Branches</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"slider-controls absolute bottom-8 right-8 z-[4] flex gap-3\"><button class=\"slider-btn flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:bg-secondary-500 hover:text-text-primary\" aria-label=\"Previous\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"slider-btn flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/20 text-white backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:bg-secondary-500 hover:text-text-primary\" aria-label=\"Next\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 z-[4] flex -translate-x-1/2 gap-3\"><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-8 bg-secondary-500\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 4\"></button><button class=\"h-3 rounded-full transition-all w-3 bg-white/50 hover:bg-white/80\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 5\"></button></div></section><section class=\"section bg-white\"><div class=\"container-page\"><div class=\"section-header\"><h2>हाम्रा मुख्य सेवाहरू</h2><p>तपाईंको भविष्य निर्माण गर्न र पारस्परिक वृद्धिलाई बढावा दिन डिजाइन गरिएका हाम्रा अनुकूलित वित्तीय उत्पादनहरूको विस्तृत श्रृंखला अन्वेषण गर्नुहोस्।</p></div><div class=\"service-grid grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"service-card group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary-500 hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"service-card-icon-wrapper mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary-50 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-secondary-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet h-7 w-7 text-primary-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-white\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-primary-500 flex items-center justify-between\">निक्षेप र बचत<span class=\"service-card-counter ml-2 rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.75rem] font-bold text-gray-500\">१४+ विकल्प</span></h3><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500\">सबैको लागि तयार पारिएको बचत खाता र उच्च ब्याजदरको मुद्दती निक्षेप योजनाहरू</p><ul class=\"service-links-list mb-5 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 transition-colors hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500 hover:border-primary-500/20\" href=\"/products/savings\">Savings Accounts<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 text-secondary-500 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500 transition-colors hover:bg-primary-50 hover:text-primary-500 hover:border-primary-500/20\" href=\"/products/fixed-deposits\">Fixed Deposits<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3 w-3 text-secondary-500 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></li></ul><div class=\"service-mini-widget rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-3 mb-5 border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"widget-title flex items-center justify-between mb-2\"><span class=\"text-[0.75rem] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400\">Yield &amp; Min Balance</span><span class=\"inline-block h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse\"></span></div><select class=\"widget-control-select w-full rounded border border-gray-200 px-2 py-1.5 text-xs bg-white mb-2 focus:border-primary-500 focus:outline-none\"><option value=\"normal\" selected=\"\">Normal Saving</option><option value=\"everest\">Everest Saving</option><option value=\"student\">Student Saving</option><option value=\"gold\">Gold Saving</option><option value=\"individual-fd\">Individual Fixed Deposit</option></select><div class=\"widget-result-panel rounded border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary-500 text-center\">4.25% p.a. | Min Bal: NPR 100</div></div><a class=\"btn btn-primary service-card-cta mt-auto w-full text-center font-bold\" href=\"/products/savings\">Compare Accounts</a></div><div class=\"service-card group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-100 bg-white p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-primary-500 hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"service-card-icon-wrapper mb-5 flex h-[60px] w-[60px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary-50 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:bg-secondary-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hand-coins h-7 w-7 text-primary-500 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-white\"><path d=\"M11 15h2a2 2 0 1 0 0-4h-3c-.6 0-1.1.2-1.4.6L3 17\"></path><path d=\"m7 21 1.6-1.4c.3-.4.8-.6 1.4-.6h4c1.1 0 2.1-.4 2.8-1.2l4.6-4.4a2 2 0 0 0-2.75-2.91l-4.2 3.9\"></path><path d=\"m2 16 6 6\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.9\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-primary-500 flex items-center justify-between\">ऋण योजनाहरू<span class=\"service-card-counter ml-2 rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.75rem] font-bold text-gray-500\">९ ऋण प्रकार</span></h3><p class=\"mb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500\">व्यक्तिगत लक्ष्य र व्यावसायिक विस्तारको लागि कम ब्याजदरको घर, सवारी, व्यवसाय र कृषि ऋण</p><ul class=\"service-links-list mb-5 flex flex-col gap-2\"><li><a class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-gr